  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-14\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 14</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Produisent leurs effets le :</p>\n      <ul class=\"hyphenated-items\">\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">1er septembre 1990 : l'article 1, l'article 6, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"18°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">\n                    <ol>\n                      <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\"><span class=\"provision-text\">, et l'article 11</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </span></li>\n            </ol>;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">1er septembre 1990 : l'article 3, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">premier tiret, l'article 5, </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">à 13° inclus, l'article 6, </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">troisième et quatrième tirets, </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"9°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"10°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"11°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"15°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"16°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"17°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"18°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">\n                    <ol>\n                      <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\"><span class=\"provision-text\">, </span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"19°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"20°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"21°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et l'article 7, pour autant que pendant la période du 1er septembre 1990 au 31 août 1997, ceci ne puisse avoir aucun impact sur la rémunération et sur la mise en disponibilité par défaut d'emploi, ni pour les membres du personnel, ni pour les pouvoirs organisateurs</span></li>\n            </ol>;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">1er septembre 1993 : l'article 3, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et l'article 4</span></li>\n            </ol>;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">1er septembre 1995 : l'article 3, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">deuxième, troisième, quatrième et cinquième tirets, et l'article 6, </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">premier tiret</span></li>\n            </ol>;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">1er septembre 1996 : l'article 5, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et l'article 6, </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"13°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"14°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n            </ol>;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">1er janvier 1997 : l'article 10;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">1er septembre 1997 : l'article 2, l'article 5, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">, l'article 6, </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">deuxième tiret, </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">premier et deuxième tirets, et </span></li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"12°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">, l'article 8, l'article 9 et l'article 13.</span></li>\n            </ol></span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
